# Markdown is deliberately outside the formatting gate, and `md` has been
# removed from the format globs in package.json so the two configs no longer
# disagree. They did for a long time: the glob claimed markdown was checked
# while this line silently excluded every .md in the repository, so the gate
# advertised coverage it did not have.
#
# The reason to keep it excluded is that prettier reformats code inside fenced
# blocks. The ADRs, the runbook and doffin-api-findings.md quote real API
# responses and real type definitions as evidence; rewriting them to prettier's
# taste would edit the evidence. Line endings in prose are a smaller problem
# than a documented API example that no longer matches what the API returned.
*.md

